      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALGORITHM (8) stalked the lead from a middle box and kept coming to win (30.86) at this track in Grade 6 over 531m. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Can make it two on the bounce. BOUNDING HOME (1) missed the frame last time but had been racing well prior to that, winning a TG1-4W three back before a placing at this track the following run. Safe beginner and drawn well on the inside. Can find the frame this time. CALAIS RAIN (6) has been in super consistent form, finishing in the minors at her last four runs. Last time finished 2nd on August 2 over 400m at this track behind Golden Zeal beaten one length (23.18) in a Grade 6. Has good speed so she should be prominent despite the draw. Can measure up. ZIPPING BELUGA (4) is sure to play a big role again after a run of minor placings.",
